{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken on a world that should not exist. The last thing you remember? Crashing onto this barren rock. But instead of the lifeless tomb you expected, you find a sprawling labyrinth of living jungles, shattered machinery, and ancient temples carved into the very heart of the planet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes two areas from the full game, in which you can find several power ups, another weapon, and a tough boss. You will explore an ancient temple in the caves of an alien planet. You might even find your way through the chrome mines and visit the desolate surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051330?t=1759285292","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051330/ca4d7f7f941722ef0d1a2c06ce805d6089b14f42/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759285292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051330/493ffce0e6dafba5f6406fb820bf7c46228b2bdf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759285292","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051330/493ffce0e6dafba5f6406fb820bf7c46228b2bdf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759285292","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken on a world that should not exist. The last thing you remember? Crashing onto this barren rock. But instead of the lifeless tomb you expected, you find a sprawling labyrinth of living jungles, shattered machinery, and ancient temples carved into the very heart of the planet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes two areas from the full game, in which you can find several power ups, another weapon, and a tough boss. You will explore an a